<http://data.silknow.org/object/f7c5cbdf-77c9-3723-9ac9-85e3e994104c>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "French doll. Bisque socket head and shoulder-plate (neck socket lined with kid to prevent chafing). Fixed blue glass eyes, closed smiling mouth. Blonde hair wig with braids and curls, on a cork pate. Body made from fine white kid leather with gusseted hip, knee and elbow joints, individually stitched fingers.\n\nWearing a fashionable day ensemble in blue wool (bodice, polonaise overskirt, hem flounce on underskirt) and sea-green/blue silk (underskirt, bow trimmings on bodice). White cotton underwear with lace trimming. Sea-green silk bonnet with scarlet silk pinked ribbons, trimmed with red silk pom-poms and black feathers. Striped blue, red and cream silk stockings and high-heeled dark leather boots with three gilt buttons.\n\nAlso associated with the doll is a white cotton nightdress with lace trimming."@en , "Fashion doll, French, circa 1875. Day ensemble in silk and wool."@en , "Unique"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/3ed8b4aa-a239-369d-a29f-10cafcedb8b4> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/8797d7a2-bc85-30de-861e-98ce748bbbea> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/ae460787-c948-3347-a7bc-134e05cb799a> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/bdbf3a79-211d-364f-be0a-7f282e242fc9> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/c074bf5b-12e2-3e17-922a-c38ce2c2d063> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/3181a3a4-cf4e-3b57-b9ba-56bfa06f1fe0> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/f82ab9de-733c-320a-af63-1e3a729c3e78> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/b12530be-d7f3-362a-9e5d-914fd9c5dfb4> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/19a263c8-00cc-3e94-91d7-e149d117915f> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "French doll. Bisque socket head and shoulder-plate (neck socket lined with kid to prevent chafing). Fixed blue glass eyes, closed smiling mouth. Blonde hair wig with braids and curls, on a cork pate. Body made from fine white kid leather with gusseted hip, knee and elbow joints, individually stitched fingers.\n\nWearing a fashionable day ensemble in blue wool (bodice, polonaise overskirt, hem flounce on underskirt) and sea-green/blue silk (underskirt, bow trimmings on bodice). White cotton underwear with lace trimming. Sea-green silk bonnet with scarlet silk pinked ribbons, trimmed with red silk pom-poms and black feathers. Striped blue, red and cream silk stockings and high-heeled dark leather boots with three gilt buttons.\n\nAlso associated with the doll is a white cotton nightdress with lace trimming."@en , "Unique"@en , "Fashion doll, French, circa 1875. Day ensemble in silk and wool."@en ;
        dc:identifier                  "T.108-1925" ;
