<http://data.silknow.org/event/75680814-94e6-33e8-bb1d-830c7cc40a5e>
        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "This doll is unmarked, however, the very high standard of her finish and specifications and the smiling mouth indicates that she was probably produced by the high-quality French dollmaker Bru. She could also be by Francois Gautier or Jumeau."@en ;
